      339       s-name AT ROW 2.04 COL 44.13 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      340       s-name-cnt AT ROW 2.04 COL 44.13 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      341       s-artic AT ROW 2.04 COL 44.13 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      342       BROWSE-2 AT ROW 3.71 COL 1
      343       FILL-IN-2 AT ROW 2.21 COL 1 NO-LABEL
      344       mark-num AT ROW 2.96 COL 1 NO-LABEL
