      529           do:
      530               run gbl/pop-up.p (self:handle, no) no-error.
      531               if error-status:error then return no-apply.
      532           end.
      533       END.
      534   ON CHOOSE OF b-print IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
      535       DO:
